#pragma code_page(65001)
// res/lang/sq.rc -- Albanian (Shqip), the strings of the interface for `[general] language = "sq"`.
//
// Stage E109, group B. Adapted, not translated word for word (decision 198.14): the source of the
// sense is en.rc and ru.rc, the place and the room of every string is res/lang/context.tsv, the
// words of the program are in l10n/glossary/sq.tsv of the control contour. The site side is
// English (GitHub Issues, as en.rc). The tone is the polite plural of Windows in Albanian
// ("ju"): the author speaks in the masculine ("jam i gëzuar"), the reader is addressed without gender.
//
// In an .rc string a backslash is an escape -- one backslash is written as two -- and a double
// quote inside a string is written as two double quotes.

// ---------------------------------------------------------------------------------------
// Albanian — `[general] language = "sq"`.
// ---------------------------------------------------------------------------------------
